  <item>
    <title>09如何好好生活？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6576f6e68593f10bf904c17a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6576f6e68593f10bf904c17a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 11 Dec 2023 11:47:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如何好好生活？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我是在生活还是在生存？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我想很多人都会有这样的疑问吧，和果果的对谈给了我很多不同的视角，好好生活的出发点竟然是对自己好一点。</span></p><span></span><p><span>嗯，一下子戳到我了。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：果果，一个在好好生活的人</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>好好生活家~</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>毕业4年，产品总监，业余爱茶</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>心理疏导，企业顾问，陪伴1000+人走出迷茫</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>终身学习者，得到学习时长4528+小时，年均阅读书籍80+…</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>Shownotes</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:00:45</a>:两个什么状态的人在聊好好生活？果果和雪飞的背景介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">00:04:55</a>:到底怎么才算好好生活？好好生活，从对自己好一点开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">00:10:34</a>:对自己好的小技巧：给自己买一束九块九的花</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="999">00:16:39</a>:工作如何不内耗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2060">00:34:20</a>:为什么总能发现生活中好玩的、好吃的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2363">00:39:23</a>:真正的好好生活：有一个喜欢钻研的兴趣爱好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">00:44:50</a>:日日是好日</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3280">00:54:40</a>:好好生活就是和滋养自己的人、事、物在一起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3421">00:57:01</a>:在生活不稳地、收入不稳地、疲于应对生存的情况下怎么好好生活？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3753">01:02:33</a>:保持规律工作可以让生活更有节奏感，可以对抗抑郁状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3909">01:05:09</a>:如何在北京（一线大城市）好好生活？来都来了，尽可能多的利用城市的资源优势，离开时不后悔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4695">01:18:15</a>:单身如何好好生活？珍惜自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4920">01:22:00</a>:最不好好生活的状态是什么样子？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>对谈中提到的书籍：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>《别让猴子跳回背上》威廉·安肯三世</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2iahO3jsFh1iQj29-esMlw?from=singlemessage&amp;isappinstalled=0&amp;scene=1&amp;clicktime=1702292616&amp;enterid=1702292616" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/2iahO3jsFh1iQj29-esMlw?from=singlemessage&amp;isappinstalled=0&amp;scene=1&amp;clicktime=1702292616&amp;enterid=1702292616"><span>《“猴子”与“教练”》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>《无用之美》林曦</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lr6sNN_I4lBeSeM62TDCHT3HpIU0.m4a" length="133670447" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:32:09</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZyVndoTGhTQ0p1eUFLWktrby1UOXAtMGJ6TzkucG5n.png"/>
