  <item>
    <title>08体验派的流动人生，欢迎来到数字游民站</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6570440b8593f10bf9d265f5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6570440b8593f10bf9d265f5</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 Dec 2023 09:51:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾是来过播客的老朋友</span><strong><span>小V（职业奇妙物语主播）</span></strong><span>，作为体验派的她开始了流动人生，从北京搬到了德清。</span></p><span></span><p><span>对于同为体验派的我来说，如果人生不能体验更多的可能性，一直困于一个状态，是会枯萎的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所有经历都是体验，带着这样的价值观去生活也会少了很多焦虑。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们主要聊了如下话题：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">00:01:35</a>:小V是如何走上数字游民之路的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="694">00:11:34</a>:如何顺利实现从北京到德清的搬迁（尤其是东西特别多的情况下）以及适应数字游民状态的转变？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">00:17:50</a>:数字游民社区里大家的相处模式是怎样的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1367">00:22:47</a>:青旅与数字游民社区有什么区别？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1553">00:25:53</a>:会有人把数字游民社区当作家吗？数字游民社区的空间设计</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">00:31:20</a>:如何在自由灵活的空间内实现内在的秩序感？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2120">00:35:20</a>:到底什么是数字游民？数字游民的两大类工作形式？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2416">00:40:16</a>:数字游民的浪漫主义色彩，它很乌托邦吗？数字游民们的真实生活状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3140">00:52:20</a>:数字游民社区为什么这么火爆？提前两周都订不到房间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4245">01:10:45</a>:数字游民社区生态是如何打破信息茧房的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4638">01:17:18</a>:数字游民社区生态是如何生长的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4778">01:19:38</a>:新世界的自运营体系：去中心化组织和自由选择</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>数字游民相关资料（部分来源自由会客厅）</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>数字游民社区DNA余村创始人徐老师的文章：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/aagoYb2A0zcGa_SSB6Cbaw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/aagoYb2A0zcGa_SSB6Cbaw"><span>当我们谈论数字游民时，我们在谈论什么——写在“余村数字游民公社”内测前</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>一些数字游民相关的书</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>《The End of Jobs》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Company of One》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Remote：Office Not Required》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Make: THE INDIE MAKER HANDBOOK》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《The Minimalist Entrepreneur》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Company of One》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《每周 4 小时工作法》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《不循规蹈矩的艺术》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《100 美元的启动资金》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《边工作边旅行》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《做一个自由自在的人》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《每周零小时工作法》</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>公众号</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>大理 HUB</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;706 青年空间</span></p><span></span><p><span>数字游民部落</span></p><span></span><p><span>自由会客厅</span></p><span></span><p><span>地理套利 Geoarbitrage</span></p><span></span><p><span>数字游民指北&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>DNA 数字游民</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>国内数字游民共享空间</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>安吉 DNA 数字游民社区</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;DAO SPACE&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>大理 HUB&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>海南文昌 Serenpidity 社区</span></p><span></span><p><span>万宁冲浪社区</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liflvwvvO1mcZJDNYwG3fPHh0-C0.m4a" length="127101222" type="audio/mp4"/>
